{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3005_027say", "source_sha256": "3db8f69d245b78019cffb3163e5f90ea47f6d5235887cd5c092e1e9bb87af1ed", "ja": "ち、違いますっ。毎日の話題選びです！\n毎朝なので、さすがに話題が尽きてきてしまって……。", "zh": "不、不是！是因为每天早上都要选话题！\n每天早上都要讲，实在快找不到话题了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3006_027say", "source_sha256": "d297a499b8f02cb2658fb37beb2535b44ad0d261a65650ca4c5a6b777b67705f", "ja": "{$P$}。さりげなくて、それでいて\nちょっとためになるような、そんな話、知りませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}，你知道些什么习以为常，\n但是又能对人有点帮助的话题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
