{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3008", "source_sha256": "b7facbc8fcdcc7b484b21cc195a4176b6c819e7bb6670ca25cb544ea6772e8a1", "ja": "朝ごはんの大切さ", "zh": "早餐的重要性", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3009", "source_sha256": "615092f5c672cfa99b852f94773f8184213c5e4f65f56e4b69a06d6a4dccde0c", "ja": "朝の運動の大切さ", "zh": "早上运动的重要性", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3200_p", "source_sha256": "39144eb4241e30de51d230fd6cecc248d2ea800342582c13e4c6c6129e431f20", "ja": "朝ごはんの大切さを説くのは、どうだ？\n1日の始まりは、朝食からだしな。", "zh": "说说早餐的重要性如何？\n毕竟一天就是从早餐开始啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3201_027say", "source_sha256": "cc3b1e752bf89b501f71288f4bad09581a312881e6c368f9d5c904acde8b0a5b", "ja": "朝ごはん……いいかもしれませんね。オススメの\n朝食メニューも、合わせて紹介できそうですし！", "zh": "早餐……说不定不错呢。\n似乎也能一并介绍推荐的早餐内容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3202_027say", "source_sha256": "c1a116ec893c204e840af67c61aaa6f30f8a782daf08b6afe4569f323c58c702", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}！\n調べてみますね♪", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}！\n我去调查看看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3300_p", "source_sha256": "39144eb4241e30de51d230fd6cecc248d2ea800342582c13e4c6c6129e431f20", "ja": "朝ごはんの大切さを説くのは、どうだ？\n1日の始まりは、朝食からだしな。", "zh": "说说早餐的重要性如何？\n毕竟一天就是从早餐开始啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3301_027say", "source_sha256": "6e6e595ace46bac55c799a80b779ed2c88c982ccb1e469198e51ff4dda2befe8", "ja": "確かに……朝食は、1日の元気の源ですもんね！\nありがとうございます、明日はその話をしてみます！", "zh": "的确……早餐是一整天的活力来源呢！\n谢谢你，我明天就说说看这个话题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3302_027say", "source_sha256": "5d6c69244ab106f41e35676bcafe7cbedadf0c0cee017d7e5d12c070b72d92a8", "ja": "ところで{$P$}は、\nちゃんと朝食とってますか？", "zh": "话说回来，{$P$}\n有好好吃早餐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3303_p", "source_sha256": "cd9fb4ee6191b454dc96a1187dd30fd42593a30b6ec0a62a7dc82463aaf84d15", "ja": "えっ、いや……努力はしてる、かな。", "zh": "咦？那个……我有在努力，吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3304_027say", "source_sha256": "32651591a0ffbb40a6044d171614fa94cc8359d98554a6827f6432ca77f6c27a", "ja": "{$P$}、ダメですよ？\n朝食は、ちゃんととってくださいね！　……ふふっ。", "zh": "{$P$}，这样不行喔。\n请你要好好吃早餐！……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3500_p", "source_sha256": "dffb5097331c8905b38f6fd0401e26756353631d9065e0cd53971dfbd0125327", "ja": "朝の運動がオススメ、って話はどうだ？　1日の\n始まりに体を動かすと、頭がスッキリするらしいぞ。", "zh": "聊建议早上做运动的话题如何？听说在一天开始时\n活动身体，可以让脑袋很清醒喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3501_027say", "source_sha256": "cc5fdeb7c42a42ee48a440dd522e2f5a80fb515ed4b2ecfb6670e6dd8910066a", "ja": "いいですね！　頭がスッキリしていたら、\nいい1日が過ごせそう……その話にしてみます！", "zh": "不错呢！脑袋清醒的话，\n感觉也能过上美好的一天……就选这个话题试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3502_027say", "source_sha256": "343fca47a869dd3cd07f1703372aa9556c1f0f90ea7edd30fd13cbeadb4b9dcf", "ja": "あっ、医学的な根拠も調べておかなくちゃ。\nありがとうございます、{$P$}！", "zh": "啊，得事先调查好医学根据才行。\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3600_p", "source_sha256": "dffb5097331c8905b38f6fd0401e26756353631d9065e0cd53971dfbd0125327", "ja": "朝の運動がオススメ、って話はどうだ？　1日の\n始まりに体を動かすと、頭がスッキリするらしいぞ。", "zh": "聊建议早上做运动的话题如何？听说在一天开始时\n活动身体，可以让脑袋很清醒喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3601_027say", "source_sha256": "22876f60188a9b9c744f2d0c5dab387304126bfeb065dea02e6323acb4ab7e13", "ja": "そうですね。運動したほうがいいとは思うんですけど、\n忙しい朝にできるんでしょうか……？", "zh": "是啊。我也觉得做运动比较好，\n可是忙碌的早晨有时间做吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3602_027say", "source_sha256": "eeed68aae53110de8da13bdac27571add24aa058af3eec22c3925188b9226c8d", "ja": "そういう{$P$}は、\n毎日、ちゃんと運動してるんですか？", "zh": "这么说来，{$P$}\n有每天好好运动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_027say_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_027say_3603_p", "source_sha256": "ee0119bdbf8851198b20f86bda37ee9a9f0f7e6cf4b58d65c4d4229883de43fb", "ja": "ぐっ……ごめん、紗代子。\nこの話は、忘れてくれ……。", "zh": "唔……抱歉，纱代子。\n忘了这个话题吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
